// Ground height under a footprint: the terrain mesh is the single source of
// truth for elevation, so the base is sampled at evaluation time rather than
// baked by the generator (a baked value would drift from the rendered mesh).
function gz(x0, y0, x1, y1) = min(
    gk_terrain_height(TERR, x0, y0), gk_terrain_height(TERR, x1, y0),
    gk_terrain_height(TERR, x0, y1), gk_terrain_height(TERR, x1, y1),
    gk_terrain_height(TERR, (x0 + x1) / 2, (y0 + y1) / 2));

